source	Aristotle, Nicomachean Ethics I.1, tr. D. P. Chase
text	Project Gutenberg ebook 8438, https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/8438
class	inference
at	S1	Every art, and every science reduced to a teachable form
fault	quantifier shift: from "every action aims at some good" to "there is some good at which every action aims"
